    "## Data Cleaning & Preprocessing\n",
    "\n",
    "Steps:\n",
    "1. Having only the three elements we need: **Area harvested**, **Yield**, **Production**.\n",
    "2. **Pivot** the long format into a wide format — one row per (Area, Item, Year) with three columns: `Area_Harvested_ha`, `Yield_kg_ha`, `Production_tons`.\n",
    "3. Drop rows where any of the three values is missing and remove zero or negative area/yield/production.\n",
    "4. Standardize column names/units.\n"
   ]
  },
